          "title": "You'll want to know: la rete",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la rete — \"the network; the internet; the net\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ho trovato la ricetta in rete. I found the recipe online."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In rete — online. In football, la rete is the goal net, and a goal."
            }
          ]
        },
